{"id":"n15907-1-10","stage":2,"title":"사투리 · 方言","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15907-1-10-1","ko":"가끔 돌아가신 어머니의 사투리가 그리워.","zh":"有时候会想念已故母亲的方言呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或。","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가신","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가신","audio":"/audio/bfc4d873fbdb148d3d22.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니의","audio":"/audio/2b010f4ec95e129befff.mp3"}},{"text":"사투리가","meaning":"方言，土话","explanation":"사투리：方言，土话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사투리","audio":"/audio/1f1fc9a85ca8294e0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15907","senseId":"1","lemma":"사투리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사투리가","audio":"/audio/c044e066148a0bc872f3.mp3"}},{"text":"그리워.","meaning":"思念，怀念","explanation":"그립다：思念，怀念；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그립다","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37070","senseId":"1","lemma":"그립다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그리워","audio":"/audio/f9031fd70f96b1ec6b3b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","ent